<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico net assets rise to $5.829 bln.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico net assets rise to $5.829 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said Friday its net international assets as of December 31 were $5.829 billion, compared to $5.70 billion on December 27.</p>
<p>The central bank said that its net international reserves as of December 31 were $17.509 billion compared to $17.172 billion on December 27.</p>
